]},{"nodeId":755060105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2004428138,"text":"おお、よかったな！","nextNodeIds":[755060106]},{"nodeId":755060106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":491603538,"text":"ただ残念ながら、パイっち提案の陰謀論は事実じゃなかったよ。","nextNodeIds":[755060107]},{"nodeId":755060107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":804626730,"text":"あの実はもともと、ミツムシが集まる場所に生えてるんだってさ。","nextNodeIds":[755060108]},{"nodeId":755060108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1633104386,"text":"うぅ…オイラだって、ファデュイとか…宝盗団とかが黒幕だなんて展開は考えてなかったぞ…ただ、優秀なガイドとしての素質を発揮しただけだ！","nextNodeIds":[755060109]},{"nodeId":755060109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3933182746,"text":"引き続きがんばって。","nextNodeIds":[755060110]},{"nodeId":755060110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3452557306,"text":"へへっ、もちろんだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[755060111]},{"nodeId":755060111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":474538234,"text":"よし、最後の任務もさっさと片付けよ。","nextNodeIds":[755060112]},{"nodeId":755060112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4246230666,"text":"おう！虫捕り隊の最後の出撃だな！","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7550601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1095"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7550602