,{"nodeId":755060202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":183174962,"text":"オロルン？なんでここに？","nextNodeIds":[755060203]},{"nodeId":755060203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1613311594,"text":"具合はどう？","nextNodeIds":[755060204]},{"nodeId":755060204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3815605778,"text":"心配してくれてありがとう。ばあちゃんに言いつけられて、苦いのを飲んで、何日も休んでたから、もう大丈夫だ。","nextNodeIds":[755060205]},{"nodeId":755060205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1122441986,"text":"オロルン、おまえもシロネンを手伝いに来たのか？","nextNodeIds":[755060206]},{"nodeId":755060206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":4276303514,"text":"ミツムシを？あ、もしかして君たちがマンテンハニーを捕まえたのか？","nextNodeIds":[755060207]},{"nodeId":755060207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3116150906,"text":"ゴクジョウハニーとカクベツハニーがいなくなったのも…そういうことだったんだな。","nextNodeIds":[755060208]},{"nodeId":755060208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":651746562,"text":"えっと…それってミツムシの名前？","nextNodeIds":[755060209]},{"nodeId":755060209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1814102730,"text":"ああ。","nextNodeIds":[755060210]},{"nodeId":755060210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":757369026,"text":"見分けやすいようにつけたけど、僕はあの子たちを評価したりはしない。たとえミツを作らなくたって、皆立派な生き物だ。","nextNodeIds":[755060211]},{"nodeId":755060211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1483647874,"text":"つまり…こいつらって、おまえが飼ってるミツムシなのか？","nextNodeIds":[755060212]},{"nodeId":755060212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1468635722,"text":"ああ。だけど、同じところで暮らしてるだけで、あの子たちの生活に関与したりはしない。仲は…いいほうだと思う。","nextNodeIds":[755060213]},{"nodeId":755060213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":1637922274,"text":"えっと…ごめん、全然知らなくて。ミツムシがアビスに汚染されたせいで、部族にまで影響が出てたから、なんとかせざるを得なかったんだよね。","nextNodeIds":[755060214]},{"nodeId":755060214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2116221314,"text":"そうそう…ミツムシを傷つけたりもしてないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[755060215]},{"nodeId":755060215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2587792602,"text":"ならよかった…気にやまないでくれ。僕もそのことを処理するために来た。","nextNodeIds":[755060216]},{"nodeId":755060216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2531846378,"text":"ただ、一つ訂正させてくれ。ミツムシはとても賢い生き物でな。アビスに汚染されたわけじゃなく、自らアビスのエネルギーを呑み込んだんだ。","nextNodeIds":[755060217]},{"nodeId":755060217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":347096458,"text":"えっ？飲み込んだ？","nextNodeIds":[755060218]},{"nodeId":755060218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1492055586,"text":"ああ。一度に少ししか飲み込めないが…その程度の量なら、体がずっと大きくなるだけで、死にはしない。","nextNodeIds":[755060219]},{"nodeId":755060219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":4144261298,"text":"その後、遠くまで飛んで、汚染物が含まれた燃素蜜珠を排出するんだ。","nextNodeIds":[755060220]},{"nodeId":755060220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":61239698,"text":"蜜珠の外殻は、アビスの汚染をある程度防ぐことができる。その方法でミツムシたちは、故郷から少しずつアビスのエネルギーを取り除こうとしているんだ。","nextNodeIds":[755060221]},{"nodeId":755060221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1916064642,"text":"数え切れないぐらいの回数を繰り返さないといけないが、みんなコツコツ働いている。アリの引っ越しにも引けを取らない。","nextNodeIds":[755060222]},{"nodeId":755060222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2029382082,"text":"そうだったのか…故郷を守ってたんだな…","nextNodeIds":[755060223]},{"nodeId":755060223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":4285588354,"text":"あいつらも、この土地が侵蝕されてるってことを知ってたんだね。","nextNodeIds":[755060224]},{"nodeId":755060224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":2676788466,"text":"ああ…マンテンハニーをはじめ、みんな必死で頑張っている。いい子たちばかりなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[755060225]},{"nodeId":755060225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1413212090,"text":"さすが「戦争の国」だね。","nextNodeIds":[755060226]},{"nodeId":755060226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":2375784906,"text":"でもオロルン、どうやってこの場所がわかったの？","nextNodeIds":[755060227]},{"nodeId":755060227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1881771714,"text":"ああ、ミツムシたちにナムベリーの種をあげたんだ。種は消化されないから、間もなくすると排泄される。","nextNodeIds":[755060228]},{"nodeId":755060228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":546131386,"text":"種が土地に落ちるとすぐに育って、実を結ぶ。だから、その植物を辿れば、ミツムシの居場所を特定できる。","nextNodeIds":[755060229]},{"nodeId":755060229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":3421647834,"text":"その場所に着いたら、蜜珠を集めて処理し、またナムベリーを使ってミツムシたちを連れ帰っていたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[755060230]},{"nodeId":755060230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1736165146,"text":"だが、君たちが代わりに済ませてくれたな。あの子たちを傷つけないでいてくれて、本当にありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[755060231]},{"nodeId":755060231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":512342698,"text":"そういうことだったのか。この実になにか裏があるんじゃないかって、オイラ疑心暗鬼だったんだぞ…","nextNodeIds":[755060232]},{"nodeId":755060232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":1139994546,"text":"なにか困ったことでもあったか？","nextNodeIds":[755060233]},{"nodeId":755060233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":306422114,"text":"いや、大丈夫だぞ！気にするな！","nextNodeIds":[755060234]},{"nodeId":755060234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":3917488458,"text":"オロルン、ちゃんとミツムシの汚染を取り除いて返すから、心配しないで。","nextNodeIds":[755060235]},{"nodeId":755060235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":4194888850,"text":"そうしてくれると助かる。みんな大事な命だから。","nextNodeIds":[755060236]},{"nodeId":755060236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1094,"speakerName":"オロルン","textMapHash":4084710322,"text":"さて、これで一段落だな。僕はこれで失礼する。今度、僕のところに遊びに来てくれ。ほかの仲間を紹介しよう。","nextNodeIds":[755060237]},{"nodeId":755060237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":774553842,"text":"楽しみにしてる。またね。","nextNodeIds":[755060238]},{"nodeId":755060238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":2733435194,"text":"ふぅ、そういうことだったのか。オロルンのやつ、「サプライズ」を仕掛ける才能はピカイチだね。","nextNodeIds":[755060239]},{"nodeId":755060239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":1548204834,"text":"#{NICKNAME}とパイっちも、ありがとね。ウチ一人だったら、ほんっと退屈だったと思う。","nextNodeIds":[755060240]},{"nodeId":755060240,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":1840378098,"text":"これ、あげる。汚染されてない燃素蜜珠だよ。別に貴重なものじゃないから。","nextNodeIds":[755060241]},{"nodeId":755060241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1095,"speakerName":"シロネン","textMapHash":3817770154,"text":"ウチらと同じように、ナタのために戦ってくれてる子を覚えておくのには、いい記念になるんじゃない？","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7550602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1095"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7550601,7550602],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROL